#### Key take-aways

* **VictoriaMetrics wins** on footprint: single spot node (~~€6) + 100 GB SSD (~~€10) for 9 GiB/month ingest.
  *Mimir would need ≥ 2 extra pods + object-store reads → \~€20–25/mo.*

* **Monitoring ingest cost is tiny** because we ship high-cardinality series to **Victoria**; Cloud-Monitoring sees only low-cardinality platform metrics.

* **BigQuery billing table** is cheap (< €1/mo) until you exceed multi-TB usage exports.

* With 10 000 users your per-region stack still fits comfortably **< €70/month**—Redis is now the top line item.

