| 20 000 users  | Compute + PD grows to 2 × node; ingest 600 MiB/day → \~€85/mo                          |
| ------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| 50 000 users  | Add second node-pool, Redis standard 5 GB ⇒ \~€160/mo                                  |
| 100 000 users | Consider separate observability cluster or move to Mimir object-store; cost \~€300+/mo |

